WEBVTT

00:08:27.545 --> 00:08:30.172
Is this really the best that we can do?

00:08:31.549 --> 00:08:36.762
The path to a world
that's free of immigration prisons

00:08:38.472 --> 00:08:42.560
does not begin by pretending
that migrants are perfect.

00:08:43.978 --> 00:08:46.063
It starts with a reality check.

00:08:47.064 --> 00:08:51.360
Immigration law tells us
that migrants are aliens.

00:08:52.611 --> 00:08:56.407
But we all know
that migrants are not aliens.

00:08:57.283 --> 00:08:59.285
Migrants are just people.